<div class="content-cards-section2">
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="content-cards-wrapper textBanner-wrapper">
      <h2 class="section-title">

        What is Directors &amp; Officers Insurance?</h2>
      <div class="textBanner_container">
        <!-- Left Content -->
        <div class="content-left">

          <p><b>Directors &amp; Officers liability insurance</b> is a liability policy that protects company directors, officers, and key decision-makers against claims arising from their managerial decisions and actions. Both private and public company directors face allegations of wrongful acts, negligence, omissions, errors, and breaches of duty from their shareholders, employees, regulators, creditors and customers.</p>
<p>To minimise such potential risks, D&amp;O insurance coverage comes in. The policy helps the directors to cover legal defence costs, settlements, and compensation expenses. Furthermore, it safeguards the personal assets of business leaders, reducing financial risks. So, they can perform their responsibilities with greater confidence. </p>
</div>
        <!-- Right Side Image -->
        <div class="content-right">
          <img src="/content/dam/revampbagic/travel-insurance/images/travel-insurance-banner-img.webp" alt="banner-img"/>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></div>
<div class="listCards">

    
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/etc.clientlibs/revampbagic/components/motor/listCards/clientlib.lc-105d68441e1e5ff65561474229b1a1e4-lc.css" type="text/css">
<script src="/etc.clientlibs/revampbagic/components/motor/listCards/clientlib.lc-cbb8c972a6925a8b1db750e4479018ff-lc.js"></script>






<section class="section-content bg-blue read-more-list flex-wrap" id="terminology">
    <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="il-container">

            <h2 class="heading2 align-center">
                Quick Overview
            </h2>

            <div class="num-block">
                <ul>

                    
                        <li class="num-row ">
                            
                            <span class="num-txt">
                                1
                            </span>

                            <p class="num-cont">
                                <strong>Coverage Type:</strong>
                                <ol><li>D &amp; O liability insurance shields company directors, officers and key decision-makers against legal actions, security claims, and alleged wrongful acts taken against them.<b> </b></li></ol>

                            </p>

                        </li>
                    
                        <li class="num-row ">
                            
                            <span class="num-txt">
                                2
                            </span>

                            <p class="num-cont">
                                <strong>Who is Covered:</strong>
                                <ol><li>Current, former, and future directors, non-executive directors, officers, legal heirs, company-appointed trustees, and spouses or domestic partners are covered.<b></b></li></ol>

                            </p>

                        </li>
                    
                        <li class="num-row ">
                            
                            <span class="num-txt">
                                3
                            </span>

                            <p class="num-cont">
                                <strong>Why Is It Important:</strong>
                                <ol><li>The policy enhances corporate governance by allowing company directors to make decisions with greater confidence. </li></ol>

                            </p>

                        </li>
                    
                        <li class="num-row ">
                            
                            <span class="num-txt">
                                4
                            </span>

                            <p class="num-cont">
                                <strong>Policy Customisation:</strong>
                                <ol><li>Depending on the coverage limits you choose, you can customise the policy features so that it matches the organisation’s size and risk profile. </li></ol>

                            </p>

                        </li>
                    
                        <li class="num-row more-list-show">
                            
                            <span class="num-txt">
                                5
                            </span>

                            <p class="num-cont">
                                <strong>Claim Process:</strong>
                                <ol><li>As soon as the policyholder makes a claim under the D &amp; O liability insurance, the insurer will review the reports and settle the claim. </li></ol>

                            </p>

                        </li>
                    
                        <li class="num-row more-list-show">
                            
                            <span class="num-txt">
                                6
                            </span>

                            <p class="num-cont">
                                <strong>Key extensions:</strong>
                                <ol><li>Company directors can extend policy protection by adding public relations expenses, counselling services after claims and pollution defence costs. </li></ol>

                            </p>

                        </li>
                    
                        <li class="num-row more-list-show">
                            
                            <span class="num-txt">
                                7
                            </span>

                            <p class="num-cont">
                                <strong>Common Exclusions:</strong>
                                <ol><li>D&amp;O liability insurance does not include fraudulent acts, bodily injury or property damage, or pollution-related claims and so on.</li></ol>

                            </p>

                        </li>
                    
                        <li class="num-row more-list-show">
                            
                            <span class="num-txt">
                                8
                            </span>

                            <p class="num-cont">
                                <strong>Risk Management:</strong>
                                <ol><li>Strengthens organisational resilience by mitigating financial consequences of management-related claims.</li></ol>

                            </p>

                        </li>
                    

                </ul>

                <a href="javascript:;" class="read-more-link">Read More</a>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>

</div>
<div class="contentCards">

    
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/etc.clientlibs/revampbagic/components/motor/contentCards/clientlib.lc-af9942058403cdf25082366c557a4d34-lc.css" type="text/css">
<script src="/etc.clientlibs/revampbagic/components/motor/contentCards/clientlib.lc-62d06c27ee938f757cd649d5ad7259a6-lc.js"></script>




   <section class="content-cards-section">
      <div class="wrapper">
         <div class="content-cards-wrapper">
            <!-- Section Heading -->
            
               <h2 class="secContheading">
                  Why is D&amp;O Liability Insurance Important?
               </h2>
            
            <!-- Section Sub Title -->
            
               <div class="content-cards-subtitle">
                  <p>Here is why D&amp;O Liability insurance is important: <b></b></p>

               </div>
            
            <!-- Cards -->
            <div class="content-cards swiper">
               <div class="content-cards-wrapper grid">
                  
                     
                        <div class="content-info-cards swiper-slide">
                           <div class="content-info-cards-header">
                              <div class="content-cards-number">
                                 <span class="red-box">
                                    
                                    
                                       <span class="red-box-number">1</span>
                                    
                                 </span>
                              </div>
                              
                                 <div class="content-cards-title">
                                    <h3>Protection of Personal Assets</h3>
                                 </div>
                              
                           </div>
                           <div class="content-info-cards-content">
                              
                                 <p>D&amp;O Liability Insurance protects the personal assets of directors and officers when they face legal claims arising from their employees or shareholders, while performing their professional responsibilities.</p>
                              
                              
                           </div>
                        </div>
                     
                        <div class="content-info-cards swiper-slide">
                           <div class="content-info-cards-header">
                              <div class="content-cards-number">
                                 <span class="red-box">
                                    
                                    
                                       <span class="red-box-number">2</span>
                                    
                                 </span>
                              </div>
                              
                                 <div class="content-cards-title">
                                    <h3>Coverage for Legal Defence Costs</h3>
                                 </div>
                              
                           </div>
                           <div class="content-info-cards-content">
                              
                                 <p>The D&amp;O insurance policy covers defence costs, legal fees and related expenses incurred while responding to covered claims. However, the coverage can be subject to certain conditions and limitations. </p>
                              
                              
                           </div>
                        </div>
                     
                        <div class="content-info-cards swiper-slide">
                           <div class="content-info-cards-header">
                              <div class="content-cards-number">
                                 <span class="red-box">
                                    
                                    
                                       <span class="red-box-number">3</span>
                                    
                                 </span>
                              </div>
                              
                                 <div class="content-cards-title">
                                    <h3>Supports Better Decision-Making</h3>
                                 </div>
                              
                           </div>
                           <div class="content-info-cards-content">
                              
                                 <p>When directors and company leaders know that their liability risks are covered, it allows them to make strategic business decisions with greater confidence and reduced personal financial concerns. </p>
                              
                              
                           </div>
                        </div>
                     
                        <div class="content-info-cards swiper-slide">
                           <div class="content-info-cards-header">
                              <div class="content-cards-number">
                                 <span class="red-box">
                                    
                                    
                                       <span class="red-box-number">4</span>
                                    
                                 </span>
                              </div>
                              
                                 <div class="content-cards-title">
                                    <h3>Enhances Corporate Governance</h3>
                                 </div>
                              
                           </div>
                           <div class="content-info-cards-content">
                              
                                 <p>D&amp;O Insurance strengthens an organisation&#39;s risk management framework and demonstrates a commitment towards responsible corporate governance and leadership accountability.</p>
                              
                              
                           </div>
                        </div>
                     
                        <div class="content-info-cards swiper-slide">
                           <div class="content-info-cards-header">
                              <div class="content-cards-number">
                                 <span class="red-box">
                                    
                                    
                                       <span class="red-box-number">5</span>
                                    
                                 </span>
                              </div>
                              
                                 <div class="content-cards-title">
                                    <h3>Attracts and Retains Leadership Talent</h3>
                                 </div>
                              
                           </div>
                           <div class="content-info-cards-content">
                              
                                 <p>Comprehensive liability protection makes organisations more attractive to experienced professionals, helping businesses recruit and retain qualified directors and senior executives.</p>
                              
                              
                           </div>
                        </div>
                     
                        <div class="content-info-cards swiper-slide">
                           <div class="content-info-cards-header">
                              <div class="content-cards-number">
                                 <span class="red-box">
                                    
                                    
                                       <span class="red-box-number">6</span>
                                    
                                 </span>
                              </div>
                              
                                 <div class="content-cards-title">
                                    <h3>Protects Reputation</h3>
                                 </div>
                              
                           </div>
                           <div class="content-info-cards-content">
                              
                                 <p>The D&amp;O policy protects a company as well as its directors’ reputation via PR and crisis management cover. Whenever a board member is sued, the policy covers its regulatory investigation expenses, legal defence costs, settlements and damages. </p>
                              
                              
                           </div>
                        </div>
                     
               </div>
               
               <!-- End Description -->
               
            </div>
         </div>
      </div>
   </section>
</div>
<div class="contentCards">

    




   <section class="content-cards-section">
      <div class="wrapper">
         <div class="content-cards-wrapper">
            <!-- Section Heading -->
            
               <h2 class="secContheading">
                  Who is Covered Under D&amp;O Liability Insurance?
               </h2>
            
            <!-- Section Sub Title -->
            
               <div class="content-cards-subtitle">
                  <p>The following individuals are covered under D&amp;O liability insurance: </p>

               </div>
            
            <!-- Cards -->
            <div class="content-cards swiper">
               <div class="content-cards-wrapper grid">
                  
                     
                        <div class="content-info-cards swiper-slide">
                           <div class="content-info-cards-header">
                              <div class="content-cards-number">
                                 <span class="red-box">
                                    
                                    
                                       <span class="red-box-number">1</span>
                                    
                                 </span>
                              </div>
                              
                                 <div class="content-cards-title">
                                    <h3>Current, Former and Future Directors</h3>
                                 </div>
                              
                           </div>
                           <div class="content-info-cards-content">
                              
                                 <p>Individuals currently serving as part of the board of directors or as officers of the company, retired or resigned individuals and those who will join the executive team in future are eligible for D&amp;O liability insurance. </p>
                              
                              
                           </div>
                        </div>
                     
                        <div class="content-info-cards swiper-slide">
                           <div class="content-info-cards-header">
                              <div class="content-cards-number">
                                 <span class="red-box">
                                    
                                    
                                       <span class="red-box-number">2</span>
                                    
                                 </span>
                              </div>
                              
                                 <div class="content-cards-title">
                                    <h3>Officers and Key Decision-Makers</h3>
                                 </div>
                              
                           </div>
                           <div class="content-info-cards-content">
                              
                                 <p>Chief executive officers, vice presidents, general managers and individuals who exercise significant decision-making in the company can safeguard their personal assets with officers&#39; liability insurance.  </p>
                              
                              
                           </div>
                        </div>
                     
                        <div class="content-info-cards swiper-slide">
                           <div class="content-info-cards-header">
                              <div class="content-cards-number">
                                 <span class="red-box">
                                    
                                    
                                       <span class="red-box-number">3</span>
                                    
                                 </span>
                              </div>
                              
                                 <div class="content-cards-title">
                                    <h3>Permanent Employees</h3>
                                 </div>
                              
                           </div>
                           <div class="content-info-cards-content">
                              
                                 <p>Permanent employees who hold supervisory or managerial positions within a company sometimes experience lawsuits alleging wrongful acts. With the liability insurance, they can eliminate financial ruin in legal battles. </p>
                              
                              
                           </div>
                        </div>
                     
                        <div class="content-info-cards swiper-slide">
                           <div class="content-info-cards-header">
                              <div class="content-cards-number">
                                 <span class="red-box">
                                    
                                    
                                       <span class="red-box-number">4</span>
                                    
                                 </span>
                              </div>
                              
                                 <div class="content-cards-title">
                                    <h3>Legal Heirs</h3>
                                 </div>
                              
                           </div>
                           <div class="content-info-cards-content">
                              
                                 <p>Legal heirs of a company director ensure personal asset protection using D&amp;O liability insurance. The policy protects them so they are not left financially liable for corporate debts after the demise of the director. </p>
                              
                              
                           </div>
                        </div>
                     
                        <div class="content-info-cards swiper-slide">
                           <div class="content-info-cards-header">
                              <div class="content-cards-number">
                                 <span class="red-box">
                                    
                                    
                                       <span class="red-box-number">5</span>
                                    
                                 </span>
                              </div>
                              
                                 <div class="content-cards-title">
                                    <h3>Company Appointed Trustees</h3>
                                 </div>
                              
                           </div>
                           <div class="content-info-cards-content">
                              
                                 <p>Company appointed trustees prudently manage trust assets. When the shareholders, regulators and beneficiaries sue the company, the insurer pays for the legal defence costs; settlements and financial damages. This helps trustees protect their personal assets too. </p>
                              
                              
                           </div>
                        </div>
                     
                        <div class="content-info-cards swiper-slide">
                           <div class="content-info-cards-header">
                              <div class="content-cards-number">
                                 <span class="red-box">
                                    
                                    
                                       <span class="red-box-number">6</span>
                                    
                                 </span>
                              </div>
                              
                                 <div class="content-cards-title">
                                    <h3>Spouses and Domestic Partners </h3>
                                 </div>
                              
                           </div>
                           <div class="content-info-cards-content">
                              
                                 <p>Since many couples share their asset ownership, plaintiffs usually take their spouses&#39; or domestic partner’s name in the lawsuit to prevent asset transfer. The spousal liability extension covers estate and defence costs. </p>
                              
                              
                           </div>
                        </div>
                     
               </div>
               
               <!-- End Description -->
               
            </div>
         </div>
      </div>
   </section>
</div>
<div class="listCards">

    






<section class="section-content bg-blue read-more-list flex-wrap" id="terminology">
    <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="il-container">

            <h2 class="heading2 align-center">
                Scope of Directors &amp; Officers Insurance Coverage
            </h2>

            <div class="num-block">
                <ul>

                    
                        <li class="num-row ">
                            
                            <span class="num-txt">
                                1
                            </span>

                            <p class="num-cont">
                                <strong>Directors and Officers Cover:</strong>
                                <ol><li>Provides financial protection to insured individuals for covered claims, unless the company has already indemnified them.</li></ol>

                            </p>

                        </li>
                    
                        <li class="num-row ">
                            
                            <span class="num-txt">
                                2
                            </span>

                            <p class="num-cont">
                                <strong>Company Reimbursement:</strong>
                                <ol><li>Reimburses the company if it pays on behalf of an insured individual.</li></ol>

                            </p>

                        </li>
                    
                        <li class="num-row ">
                            
                            <span class="num-txt">
                                3
                            </span>

                            <p class="num-cont">
                                <strong>Company Securities Claim Cover:</strong>
                                <ol><li>Protects the company from claims related to securities, such as shareholder disputes.</li></ol>

                            </p>

                        </li>
                    
                        <li class="num-row ">
                            
                            <span class="num-txt">
                                4
                            </span>

                            <p class="num-cont">
                                <strong>Corporate Governance Coverage:</strong>
                                <div><ol style="	margin-top: 0.0cm;
" start="1" type="1"><li class="MsoNormal" style="	margin-top: 10.0pt;
	margin-bottom: 10.0pt;
	text-align: justify;
">Strengthens corporate
     governance by acting as an external oversight mechanism that mitigates
     risks and enforces financial accountability on management. <span lang="EN" style="	font-size: 12.0pt;
	line-height: 115.0%;
	font-family: Calibri , sans-serif;
"></span></li></ol>
</div>

                            </p>

                        </li>
                    

                </ul>

                <a href="javascript:;" class="read-more-link">Read More</a>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>

</div>
<div class="listCards">

    






<section class="section-content bg-blue read-more-list flex-wrap" id="terminology">
    <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="il-container">

            <h2 class="heading2 align-center">
                What are extensions for D&amp;O Liability Insurance Plan
            </h2>

            <div class="num-block">
                <ul>

                    
                        <li class="num-row ">
                            
                            <span class="num-txt">
                                1
                            </span>

                            <p class="num-cont">
                                <strong>Inquiry Defence Costs:</strong>
                                <ol><li>Covered expenses for retention of legal counsel whenever a regulatory, criminal or governmental investigation is active. </li></ol>

                            </p>

                        </li>
                    
                        <li class="num-row ">
                            
                            <span class="num-txt">
                                2
                            </span>

                            <p class="num-cont">
                                <strong>Limit for Non-executive Directors:</strong>
                                <ol><li>It is a dedicated additional pool of insurance funds that are reserved solely for independent or non-executive board members.  </li></ol>

                            </p>

                        </li>
                    
                        <li class="num-row ">
                            
                            <span class="num-txt">
                                3
                            </span>

                            <p class="num-cont">
                                <strong>Public Relations Expenses:</strong>
                                <ol><li>To mitigate and prevent negative publicity, the policy covers the cost of hiring professional PR consultants. </li></ol>

                            </p>

                        </li>
                    
                        <li class="num-row ">
                            
                            <span class="num-txt">
                                4
                            </span>

                            <p class="num-cont">
                                <strong>Extradition-related Legal Costs:</strong>
                                <ol><li>Whenever the director faces formal legal proceedings or an arrest warrant, the policy covers the attorney fees, court expenses, and administrative costs. </li></ol>

                            </p>

                        </li>
                    
                        <li class="num-row more-list-show">
                            
                            <span class="num-txt">
                                5
                            </span>

                            <p class="num-cont">
                                <strong>Defence Cost Advancement:</strong>
                                <ol><li>It is a provision in a D&amp;O liability policy that enables insurers to cover legal expenses during an urgent crisis, even when the policyholder did not ask for prior consent. </li></ol>

                            </p>

                        </li>
                    
                        <li class="num-row more-list-show">
                            
                            <span class="num-txt">
                                6
                            </span>

                            <p class="num-cont">
                                <strong>Pollution Defence Cost Extensions: :</strong>
                                <ol><li>This type of add-on covers legal expenses of lawsuits that are particularly related to environmental contamination. </li></ol>

                            </p>

                        </li>
                    
                        <li class="num-row more-list-show">
                            
                            <span class="num-txt">
                                7
                            </span>

                            <p class="num-cont">
                                <strong>Occupational Health and Safety:</strong>
                                <ol><li>It pays for legal charges when there is a lawsuit on workplace safety breaches and fatalities.  </li></ol>

                            </p>

                        </li>
                    
                        <li class="num-row more-list-show">
                            
                            <span class="num-txt">
                                8
                            </span>

                            <p class="num-cont">
                                <strong>Counselling Services After Claims:</strong>
                                <ol><li>This add-on covers the cost of professional mental health and psychological support that company directors require after undergoing stress, trauma and reputational fallout.<b></b></li></ol>

                            </p>

                        </li>
                    

                </ul>

                <a href="javascript:;" class="read-more-link">Read More</a>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>

</div>
<div class="contentCards">

    




   <section class="content-cards-section">
      <div class="wrapper">
         <div class="content-cards-wrapper">
            <!-- Section Heading -->
            
               <h2 class="secContheading">
                  What are Exclusions under D&amp;O Insurance Plan
               </h2>
            
            <!-- Section Sub Title -->
            
               <div class="content-cards-subtitle">
                  <p>The exclusions of Directors and Officers Liability Cover include: </p>

               </div>
            
            <!-- Cards -->
            <div class="content-cards swiper">
               <div class="content-cards-wrapper grid">
                  
                     
                        <div class="content-info-cards swiper-slide">
                           <div class="content-info-cards-header">
                              <div class="content-cards-number">
                                 <span class="red-box">
                                    
                                    
                                       <span class="red-box-number">1</span>
                                    
                                 </span>
                              </div>
                              
                                 <div class="content-cards-title">
                                    <h3>Fraudulent Acts</h3>
                                 </div>
                              
                           </div>
                           <div class="content-info-cards-content">
                              
                                 <p>When there are claims triggered by proven fraud, dishonesty, or intentional wrongful acts by insured directors or officers, the policy coverage does not apply.</p>
                              
                              
                           </div>
                        </div>
                     
                        <div class="content-info-cards swiper-slide">
                           <div class="content-info-cards-header">
                              <div class="content-cards-number">
                                 <span class="red-box">
                                    
                                    
                                       <span class="red-box-number">2</span>
                                    
                                 </span>
                              </div>
                              
                                 <div class="content-cards-title">
                                    <h3>Personal Profit or Advantage</h3>
                                 </div>
                              
                           </div>
                           <div class="content-info-cards-content">
                              
                                 <p>The policy does not cover losses incurred by insured individuals for illegal personal gains, profits, or benefits. </p>
                              
                              
                           </div>
                        </div>
                     
                        <div class="content-info-cards swiper-slide">
                           <div class="content-info-cards-header">
                              <div class="content-cards-number">
                                 <span class="red-box">
                                    
                                    
                                       <span class="red-box-number">3</span>
                                    
                                 </span>
                              </div>
                              
                                 <div class="content-cards-title">
                                    <h3>Criminal Conduct</h3>
                                 </div>
                              
                           </div>
                           <div class="content-info-cards-content">
                              
                                 <p>Claims that involve criminal acts, violations of law, or deliberate misconduct are generally excluded from coverage.</p>
                              
                              
                           </div>
                        </div>
                     
                        <div class="content-info-cards swiper-slide">
                           <div class="content-info-cards-header">
                              <div class="content-cards-number">
                                 <span class="red-box">
                                    
                                    
                                       <span class="red-box-number">4</span>
                                    
                                 </span>
                              </div>
                              
                                 <div class="content-cards-title">
                                    <h3>Bodily Injury and Property Damage</h3>
                                 </div>
                              
                           </div>
                           <div class="content-info-cards-content">
                              
                                 <p>D&amp;O Insurance typically excludes claims involving bodily injury, death, or physical property damage liabilities.</p>
                              
                              
                           </div>
                        </div>
                     
                        <div class="content-info-cards swiper-slide">
                           <div class="content-info-cards-header">
                              <div class="content-cards-number">
                                 <span class="red-box">
                                    
                                    
                                       <span class="red-box-number">5</span>
                                    
                                 </span>
                              </div>
                              
                                 <div class="content-cards-title">
                                    <h3>Prior Known Claims</h3>
                                 </div>
                              
                           </div>
                           <div class="content-info-cards-content">
                              
                                 <p>Claims arising from circumstances known before policy inception or previously reported matters are generally excluded.</p>
                              
                              
                           </div>
                        </div>
                     
                        <div class="content-info-cards swiper-slide">
                           <div class="content-info-cards-header">
                              <div class="content-cards-number">
                                 <span class="red-box">
                                    
                                    
                                       <span class="red-box-number">6</span>
                                    
                                 </span>
                              </div>
                              
                                 <div class="content-cards-title">
                                    <h3>Contractual Liabilities</h3>
                                 </div>
                              
                           </div>
                           <div class="content-info-cards-content">
                              
                                 <p>Liabilities assumed solely through contractual agreements, without a wrongful act, are usually not covered.</p>
                              
                              
                           </div>
                        </div>
                     
               </div>
               
               <!-- End Description -->
               
            </div>
         </div>
      </div>
   </section>
</div>
